    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35909" root="قطر" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُطَارَةٌ</span></b>  <i>What drops,</i> or <i>drips,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا قَطَرَ</span>,) <i>from a
jar</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبّ</span>) <i>and the like:</i> (Lh, S:) or <i>from a
thing.</i> (K.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطْرٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A small quantity</i>
of water. (Lh, K. *) Ex. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى الإِنَآءِ قُطَارَةٌ مِنْ مَآءٍ</span>
<i>In the vessel is a little water.</i> (Lh.)

